{"version":1,"key":"card:454","content":{"id":454,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"9ffbf20c-a81e-4fa6-b219-7f37b3ca1d77","children":[{"type":"underline","color":"red","lineType":"solid","colorSelectOpen":false,"tauContract":"88d9b3835432080ad1c02f70cd42c22df8b46febe5e2b08b10394f654a84380a","collabId":"34f23474-d016-418e-9f8f-05cbe381093c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在错误条件出现时立即崩溃胜过以后再崩溃"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"（开发时解 bug 总比上线出现问题解 bug 好）。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"d139ccbe-8974-4578-9bf5-994b0e62478f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"断言是一种有效的调试工具，用于验证编程过程中的假设。通过在代码中插入断言语句，可以快速检查程序的状态是否如预期，并能够帮助开发人员快速发现问题。"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"py","uuid":"0a5af33f-633a-45f9-b0e5-c898c0c015c2","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"c840514b-9d19-4c6f-a5d8-2cf5de899a83","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"assert condition, message","collabId":"9d1d9a29-dfca-4e48-8f94-2bfb306a14c7","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"9965cefc-48d7-4c8e-9c56-86bc47891625","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"ae604d7d-c5f1-4cd4-a3b1-8bcff8580ea2","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"830c5509-39cd-450b-8465-4606d1022597","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"condition"},{"type":"formatted","text":"：一个可以是任何返回布尔值的表达式。如果条件为 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"False"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，则触发断言错误"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"57ff54f5-2333-48f2-bc7d-5f4e80142c6e","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"716ac908-34ac-446c-ac87-ac53fe784864","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"message"},{"type":"formatted","text":"：可选项，用于指定断言失败时显示的错误消息"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"86e6fb24-4ce4-4664-bb7f-f7d38b021bdc","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"当断言的条件为假时，会触发 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"AssertionError"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 异常，从而帮助开发人员调试程序并识别问题所在"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"py","uuid":"8697cb80-9cc8-4257-971c-112435995818","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"1112c303-456b-4c27-bd51-7745ab0b62a2","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":">>> age = 10\n>>> assert 0 < age < 100\n\n>>> age = -1\n>>> assert 0 < age < 100\nTraceback (most recent call last):\n  File \"<stdin>\", line 1, in <module>\nAssertionError","collabId":"177a82f3-eb0f-4ef5-9264-62037b2e2cd8","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"py","uuid":"cd788896-823a-41f8-a6bc-617859be0210","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"0e8fabab-a831-4d96-8c1c-16f8cda67624","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":">>> age = -1\n>>> assert 0 < age < 100, 'The age must be realistic'\nTraceback (most recent call last):\n  File \"<stdin>\", line 1, in <module>\nAssertionError: The age must be realistic","collabId":"39695dc5-cd0b-4e37-877d-c3aadc949786","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]}],"tags":["Python/断言"],"createTime":1719189959873,"updateTime":1743303640441,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1743303640441}}